   "text": {
    "L1": "Food does three important jobs in our body.",
    "L2": "Energy-giving foods like roti, rice and potatoes give us energy to play and work.",
    "L3": "Body-building foods like dal, milk and paneer help us grow and repair our body.",
    "L4": "Protective foods are fruits and vegetables. They keep us healthy, help fight illness and give fibre.",
    "L5": "A balanced meal has some food from each group, plus water, in the right amounts.",
    "L6": "We need fat in small amounts. Food that tastes good is not always healthy.",
    "L7": "So build your plate with energy-giving, body-building and protective foods.",
    "L8": "Now choose the meal that shows a balanced plate."
   },
